OL,11,G0232 Assignment
OL,12,     FChina once thought it had too many
OL,13,     Fchildren - now it thinks there are
OL,14,     Ftoo few. Its population is
OL,15,     Fdeclining. Micky Bristow looks
OL,16,     Finto what this means for the
OL,17,     Ffuture.
OL,18,G0300 BBC News
OL,19,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,20,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
