OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FAs a child, Nina Blom experienced
OL,7,     Fyears of hospitalisation and pain
OL,8,     Fbefore one doctor discovered what
OL,9,     Freally lay behind it all.
OL,10,G0350 Witness History
OL,11,     FIn 1962, cameras were allowed into
OL,12,     Fthe renovated White House for the
OL,13,     Ffirst televised tour. And, acting
OL,14,     Fas the guide, was one of America's
OL,15,     Fmost famous first ladies, Jackie
OL,16,     FKennedy.
